WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.311
Recommend a workable option without promising it There may

00:00:04.376 --> 00:00:09.219
be more than one defensible recommendation Operations might handle

00:00:09.258 --> 00:00:13.337
the delivery-sequence discussion if the required delegation and acceptance

00:00:13.403 --> 00:00:17.192
are obtained A later executive slot may work if

00:00:17.192 --> 00:00:21.100
it meets the useful decision time Changing the morning

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:25.758
needs an explicit decision about its consequences Lunch at

00:00:25.771 --> 00:00:29.745
another venue is a separate business protective and service-scope

00:00:29.837 --> 00:00:35.732
question Explore the conditions without inventing a reply Choose

00:00:35.732 --> 00:00:39.771
an option state its conditions and distinguish the executive’s

00:00:39.837 --> 00:00:44.548
business choice from EPO input and room acceptance Explore

00:00:44.561 --> 00:00:46.390
a different route after feedback
